00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:37.460
They're both material design,
because we chose that option,

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:41.850
but they're both made to look
like the native application

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.950
themselves.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:46.130
And how Flutter works
behind the scenes

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:50.810
is this is actually more like
how a video game renders,

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.990
as opposed to,
say, React Native,

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:57.240
or Cordova, or something like
that, where it's a web page

